        <body>
            <div xml:id="d767">

                <pb facs="1062" n="956" sameAs="frus:frus1933-39/pg956"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760p.6111/48: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-10-05T21:00:00+03:00">October 5, 1939—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 5—6 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>687. The Soviet-Latvian pact was signed this afternoon. Following a dinner at the
                    Kremlin the Latvian Foreign Minister left this evening by train for Riga. The
                    text of the pact is not yet available but is expected to be released tonight by
                    Tass.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Riga.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
